---
// Closed until the wishes API is connected. Never simulate a saved submission.
---
<section id="wishes" class="section wishes" aria-labelledby="wishes-heading">
  <div class="narrow">
    <header class="center" data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow">Words we will treasure</p>
      <h2 id="wishes-heading">Doa &amp; ucapan</h2>
      <p class="intro">Sepatah doa, sejuta makna.<br />Titipkan harapan baik untuk awal perjalanan kami.</p>
    </header>
    <form aria-describedby="wishes-note" data-wishes-form>
      <p id="wishes-note" class="notice"><span aria-hidden="true">✧</span> Buku ucapan akan segera dibuka.</p>
      <fieldset disabled>
        <legend class="sr-only">Tulis doa dan ucapan</legend>
        <div class="field"><label for="wish-name">Nama Anda</label><input id="wish-name" name="name" autocomplete="name" maxlength="100" placeholder="Tulis nama Anda" required /></div>
        <div class="field"><label for="wish-message">Doa &amp; ucapan</label><textarea id="wish-message" name="message" rows="4" maxlength="1000" placeholder="Tuliskan harapan baik Anda di sini…" required></textarea></div>
        <button class="button" type="submit">Kirim ucapan <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
      </fieldset>
      <p class="status" role="status" data-wishes-status></p>
    </form>
    <div class="empty center" data-wishes-list aria-live="polite"><span class="empty-mark" aria-hidden="true">❧</span><p>Ruang kecil untuk doa-doa yang indah.</p><p class="muted">Ucapan akan hadir di sini setelah buku dibuka.</p></div>
    <button class="button" type="button" data-wishes-more hidden>Muat ucapan lainnya</button>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .wishes { padding-bottom: 2rem; }
  .intro { font-family: var(--font-display); color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.2rem; }
  form { margin-top: 2.5rem; padding: clamp(1.25rem, 4vw, 2.2rem); border: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .notice { margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-size: .75rem; color: var(--muted); }
  .notice span { color: var(--accent); padding-right: .4rem; }
  .empty { margin-top: 2rem; padding: 1rem 0; }
  .empty-mark { font-size: 2rem; color: #82926c; }
  .empty p { margin: .2rem 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.2rem; }
  .empty .muted { font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: .7rem; }
  .status:empty { display: none; }
</style>
